WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.927
Before running each example, think about the question being answered.

00:00:03.927 --> 00:00:06.402
Are we describing a typical value?

00:00:06.402 --> 00:00:09.797
Comparing groups? Looking for a relationship?

00:00:09.797 --> 00:00:12.669
Measuring uncertainty? Choosing a visual?

00:00:13.142 --> 00:00:17.024
Then run the code and explain the result in plain language.

00:00:17.024 --> 00:00:22.806
That translation from output to interpretation is the core skill in this module.
